---
/**
 * About — short bio. First-person, plain English, specific.
 *
 * Two CTAs: LinkedIn (primary in this section) + email me (secondary).
 * No photo here — photo is in hero only per BRIEF.md.
 */

import { LINKEDIN_URL, CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../config";
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <header class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2 class="headline">About me.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="about-prose">
      <p>
        I'm Tulsa. I run <strong>Look Consulting</strong> out of Dubai. Look helps B2B founders
        and operators cut their cost-per-lead in half through interactive lead magnets, paid
        ads, and the AI plumbing behind both.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before Look, I built and sold marketing infrastructure for a string of operators across
        property, formation, and fintech. The pattern was always the same — generic playbooks
        flat-out underperform, but the right interactive surface plus a clean attribution loop
        moves real numbers. Look is that pattern, productized.
      </p>
      <p>
        Half my time goes into client work; the other half goes into shipping the agents,
        dashboards, and automations that make Look itself run like a 10-person team with one
        operator. The internal AI plumbing is the same as what I build for clients.
      </p>
      <p>
        Two ways to get in touch. The fast way is
        <a href={LINKEDIN_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a> — that's
        where the long-form writing lives, and where I reply fastest. The direct way is
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> — goes straight to my inbox,
        I usually reply within a day.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-header {
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-header .headline {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-prose {
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .about-prose p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .about-prose p + p {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-prose strong {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
